WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.819 --> 00:00:11.645
Diego Alvarez: Hey Tanya, hey Greg. Thanks for making time this afternoon. How's everything going out in Phoenix?

2
00:00:12.395 --> 00:00:18.811
Tanya Mercer: Hi Diego. It's good. Busy, but good. We're heading into that end-of-quarter push, so the BDC is hopping.

3
00:00:19.657 --> 00:00:25.434
Greg Hollis: Yeah, and it's still 105 degrees, so nobody's sad about being inside on the phones.

4
00:00:25.889 --> 00:00:35.246
Diego Alvarez: I bet. I wanted to check in on a few logistics things and see how the past month has looked from your side.

5
00:00:36.478 --> 00:00:45.347
Tanya Mercer: Sure. Things have been steady. We had a couple of new hires start in the BDC, so I'm getting them up to speed on the lead flow.

6
00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.579
Diego Alvarez: Nice. How many new folks are we talking about?

7
00:00:50.145 --> 00:00:57.861
Tanya Mercer: Two, as of last Monday. One came over from the service side, so she knows the brand already.

8
00:00:58.873 --> 00:01:05.939
Greg Hollis: And they both need access to the platform, so I flagged that to our IT guy, Rob.

9
00:01:06.759 --> 00:01:15.941
Diego Alvarez: Got it. If you send me their names and email addresses, I can make sure the user setup is squared away on our end.

10
00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:18.619
Diego Alvarez: No rush, whenever you have a minute.

11
00:01:19.391 --> 00:01:28.137
Tanya Mercer: I'll get that over to you this afternoon. I meant to do it earlier in the week and it slipped.

12
00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:37.365
Diego Alvarez: No problem at all. Speaking of scheduling, we had the next training session on the calendar for October 8, right?

13
00:01:37.758 --> 00:01:40.424
Greg Hollis: I think so. Is that a Thursday?

14
00:01:40.732 --> 00:01:46.828
Diego Alvarez: It is. Does that still work for your team, or do you want to move it?

15
00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:54.961
Tanya Mercer: Thursday afternoons are usually fine. Let me just double-check with the floor supervisor, Renee, and get back to you.

16
00:01:56.320 --> 00:02:00.248
Greg Hollis: Renee's out until Monday, so we'll confirm early next week.

17
00:02:01.498 --> 00:02:05.749
Diego Alvarez: Works for me. I'll hold the slot and we can adjust if needed.

18
00:02:05.974 --> 00:02:16.226
Tanya Mercer: Perfect. Oh, and one more logistics thing. We're adding a couple of temporary numbers for the Labor Day sales event that ran last month.

19
00:02:16.226 --> 00:02:18.361
Tanya Mercer: Those will roll off soon.

20
00:02:19.313 --> 00:02:25.491
Diego Alvarez: Okay, noted. If you need help mapping those to the right campaigns, just let me know.

21
00:02:26.817 --> 00:02:32.973
Greg Hollis: I think our marketing coordinator, Beth, handled that. She's been on top of it.

22
00:02:34.002 --> 00:02:40.083
Diego Alvarez: Great. And how did the holiday weekend volume look? I know it's usually a spike for you.

23
00:02:40.387 --> 00:02:48.980
Tanya Mercer: It was up, but not crazy. We saw a decent lift on the Friday and Saturday, then it settled down.

24
00:02:49.296 --> 00:02:52.889
Greg Hollis: Yeah, it was a steady weekend. Nothing we couldn't handle.

25
00:02:54.175 --> 00:03:00.255
Diego Alvarez: Good to hear. Are you seeing the usual seasonal pattern as you head into fall?

26
00:03:00.665 --> 00:03:08.763
Tanya Mercer: Pretty much. We always get a bump when the new models start hitting the lots. That's usually late September, early October.

27
00:03:09.211 --> 00:03:15.676
Greg Hollis: And football season, oddly enough. People watch the games and then decide to go car shopping on Monday.

28
00:03:16.153 --> 00:03:23.468
Diego Alvarez: That tracks. Well, I'll keep an eye on the volume trends and flag anything that looks unusual.

29
00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:26.205
Tanya Mercer: Sounds good. We appreciate that.

30
00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:35.508
Diego Alvarez: Before we wrap, is there anything you need from me on the account side? Anything on the roadmap to talk through?

31
00:03:36.908 --> 00:03:39.523
Greg Hollis: Not right now. Everything's been running fine.

32
00:03:40.526 --> 00:03:45.174
Tanya Mercer: Yeah, we're good. Just the user stuff and the training date.

33
00:03:46.662 --> 00:03:54.024
Diego Alvarez: Great. I'll send you a quick recap after this with the action items and the October 8 hold.

34
00:03:54.654 --> 00:03:55.887
Tanya Mercer: Perfect. Thanks, Diego.

35
00:03:56.991 --> 00:03:58.400
Greg Hollis: Appreciate it. Talk soon.

36
00:03:59.315 --> 00:04:02.698
Diego Alvarez: Thanks, both. Have a great weekend. Bye now.
